{"strongs": "H4649", "word": "מֻפִּים", "translit": "mup.pim", "root": "מפים", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "family name in Benjamin", "definition": "מֻפִּים proper name, masculine family name in Benjamin , Gen 46:21 , ᵑ6 Μαμφειν ; but 1Chr 7:12 שֻׁפִּם q. v. מֵפִיץ see פוץ מַפָּל , מַפָּלָה , מַפֶּ֫לֶת see נפל . [ מִפְלָאָה ] see פלא . [ מִפְלַגָּה ] see פלג . מִפְלָט see פלט . מִפְלֶ֫צֶת see פלץ . [ מִפְלָשׂ ] see פלשׂ = פלס . [ מִפְעָל , מִפְעָלָה ] see פעל . מֵ פָ֑֫עַת see מֵיפַ֫עַת below יפע . [ מַפָּץ ], מַפֵּץ see נפץ . מִפְקָד see פקד . [ מִפְרָץ ] see פרץ . [ מַפְרֶ֫קֶת ] see פדק . [ מִפְרָשׂ ] see פרשׂ . מִפְשָׂעָה see פשׂע . מַפְתֵּחַ , [ מִפְתָּח ] see פתח . מִפְתָּן see פתן . מֵץ Isa 1Chr 16:4 see מיץ . מֹץ see מוץ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4774')\">BDB4774</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4649')\">H4649</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4773')\">BDB4773</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4775')\">BDB4775</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מֻפִּים</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>family name in Benjamin</highlightword>, <ref ref=\"Gen 46:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,21)\">Gen 46:21</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Μαμφειν</grk>; but <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,12)\">1Chr 7:12</ref> <bdbheb>שֻׁפִּם</bdbheb> q. v. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>מֵפִיץ</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>פוץ</reflink></bdbheb> </p><hr><p><bdbheb>מַפָּל</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מַפָּלָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מַפֶּ֫לֶת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>נפל</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr><p>[<bdbheb>מִפְלָאָה</bdbheb>] see  <bdbheb><reflink>פלא</reflink></bdbheb>. [<bdbheb>מִפְלַגָּה</bdbheb>] see  <bdbheb><reflink>פלג</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>מִפְלָט</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>פלט</re